B.XU=new A.iw("csbfp","Canada Small Business Financing Program","Loans","Canada","Government-backed lending through participating financial institutions for eligible business costs.","Lender approval required. Share purchases are not eligible; check eligible asset and operating costs before structuring a purchase.","https://ised-isde.canada.ca/site/canada-small-business-financing-program/en/frequently-asked-questions-small-businesses")
