B.abI=new A.d8("Define your ideal business","Choose the industries, locations and size of business you want to explore. Think about the work you want to do each week, the skills you bring and the responsibilities you want to take on.",B.ajV)
B.aml=s(["Available personal capital","Target purchase range","Financing questions"],t.s)
B.abE=new A.d8("Set a realistic search range","Record the capital you can contribute and the purchase range you want to investigate. Separate what is available today from financing that still needs a lender\u2019s approval.",B.aml)
