B.anP=s(["Relevant reviews","Respectful communication","Confidential information"],t.s)
B.abM=new A.d8("Reviews and respectful use","Share honest experiences and keep reviews relevant to the professional\u2019s work. Avoid private client details, confidential deal information, impersonation and abusive content. Example reviews are previews and do not rate a real member.",B.anP)
